# Deny by default, for the reason bitcoin-datadir/.gitignore's own
# comment gives in full: this directory tracks its own configuration
# and documentation -- `.gitignore`, `README.md` -- and nothing else,
# and everything else it ever holds is Electrum's own runtime state,
# whose shape belongs to Electrum's releases rather than to this tree.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
